#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-na/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Prompt-word corpus index[/bold #D7AFFF]                                      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]index[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]index: build the immutable prompt-word corpus index (word stats, prompt [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]co-occurrence postings, case-folded prefix lookup) behind a per-shard [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tokenization cache, and re-express the existing MRU word list on top of [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]it without changing its output.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Relation, recency, and frequency scoring[/bold #D7AFFF]                      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]ranking[dim] · [dim][/dim]after index[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]ranking: add the pure scoring engine that turns the corpus index plus [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the current prompt text into ranked words with per-signal contributions,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]a dominant reason, and the evidence each row displays.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Warm cache, menu, and settings wiring[/bold #D7AFFF]                         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]wiring[dim] · [dim][/dim]after ranking[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]wiring: hold the index in the app-global warm cache, apply deletions at [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]query time, feed ranked candidates into the history-word menu, order [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]prompt-local words nearest-first, and add the two ranking settings.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Ranking signals in the completion panel[/bold #D7AFFF]                       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]signals[dim] · [dim][/dim]after wiring[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]signals: render the stacked score meter, dominant-reason chip, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]colored panel legend for history-word rows, degrade cleanly on narrow [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]panels, and refresh the docs and PNG goldens.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-na","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.5","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-na.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","role_suffix":"plan","vcs_provider":"GitHub","workflow_name":"sase-na.1"},"source_run_id":"run-209354f6b1ae90f0527d2a666d11115a","started_at":"2026-08-16T16:23:17.629169+00:00","state":"completed"},{"commits":[{"committed_at":1786903817,"sha":"b0585490e2457e0ee78c7eee9ed9d5d4ae7b5450","subject":"feat(history): add prompt word ranking engine"}],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"17efe8e97664083f90f55aac5fd54c4a665e510b381a0ca8b03e78d6306d413d","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-na.2/chat.md","size_bytes":18118},"commits":{"digest":"497936ca73071c98e2193a233529f4d6dc5f79982e879fbb90f5768860137baa","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-na.2/commits.json","size_bytes":223},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"a398c70160fe308637edd70b38d8cf02cc697183c480675d10f387d529663058","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-na.2/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":80},"meta":{"digest":"9050ef4aad4499f8da70abeb20130795a1f37d6c0c628f775f38307ffd5cad9f","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-na.2/meta.json","size_bytes":633},"prompt":{"digest":"8baaba8b811c2e8d0411889fc52c6573436ae382e41b390884c889bb53ac1346","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-na.2/prompt.md","size_bytes":141},"prompt_steps":{"digest":"90fd307106c9e4084257f7f9a67e245fac2c5f9ef1e9095b8d1e6fd552bce386","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-na.2/prompt_steps.json","size_bytes":22681},"state":{"digest":"1c3a419845c25adbf4fc9e3767a4204fd4170b